  "description": "Production engineering guide to implementing Anthropic Contextual Retrieval. Learn how to prepend contextual explanatory headers to document chunks using Claude prompt caching, tune BM25 k1 and b parameters, and boost top-20 retrieval accuracy by up to 49%.",
  "url": "https://raginspect.pages.dev/contextual-retrieval-anthropic-chunk-enrichment-guide/",
